<title>SINGAPORE: Asia Food&amp;Prop debuts at high of US$1.44.</title>
<headline>Asia Food&amp;Prop debuts at high of US$1.44.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Food &amp; Properties (AFP), Indonesian Sinar Mas 's rescue vehicle for former Amcol Holdings Ltd, hit a high of US$1.44 in early Friday trade.</p>
